        "original_id": "33cf1073-9f51-5490-aa91-703a2d5abb8d",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Christian Slater, Mark Gordon, Graham Yost, Mikael Salomon, Mark Romanek, k.d. lang\n- Works: Hard Rain, Interview with the Vampire, Broken Arrow, Constant Craving, Waiting for Godot\n- Events: 1993 MTV Video Music Awards\n- Places: Gibson Amphitheatre, Los Angeles\n\nFacts:\n- In 1993, Christian Slater hosted the 1993 MTV Video Music Awards at the Gibson Amphitheatre in Los Angeles.\n- At the 1993 MTV Video Music Awards, a Mark Romanek-directed music video among other nominated videos was the Waiting for Godot-based \"Constant Craving,\" performed by k.d. lang.\n- In the 1990s, Christian Slater starred in big-budget films including Interview with the Vampire, Broken Arrow, and Hard Rain.\n- Hard Rain is a 1998 action-thriller disaster film produced by Mark Gordon, written by Graham Yost, and directed by Mikael Salomon.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
